      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7311485::web::011::results_and_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduced grain-boundary cohesion leads to cavitation or intergranular decohesion.",
